        "subject": "=Your AI receptionist for {{ $json.body.business_name }} is live",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1c1f24\"><p>Hi,</p><p>Your AI receptionist is ready. Two things:</p><p><b>1. Add it to your website.</b> Paste this line before the closing &lt;/body&gt; tag (or send it to whoever manages your site):</p><pre style=\"background:#f4f5f7;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;white-space:pre-wrap\">{{ $json.body.links.widget.replaceAll('&', '&amp;').replaceAll('<', '&lt;').replaceAll('>', '&gt;') }}</pre><p><b>2. Bookmark your dashboard.</b> Every booking, lead, alert and conversation shows up here:<br><a href=\"{{ $json.body.links.dashboard }}\">{{ $json.body.links.dashboard }}</a></p><p>You'll get an email for every booking and urgent request, and a report on the 1st of each month. Reply to this email any time you want to change hours, prices or services.</p></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "bccList": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_EMAIL"
        }
